.scratch/

# A pack is a build artifact. One was committed by accident, which put a
# 226 KB binary in the history of a package whose whole job is to be small.
*.tgz

# The package build writes a declaration beside every Svelte or TypeScript
# file a test imports. A fixture under tests/ ships nowhere, so its declaration
# is noise, and Prettier reads this file too, so the emitted file stays out of
# its check.
tests/fixtures/*.d.ts
